      "id": "li4tux0",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "8. Problems of Indian Agriculture"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ercef8c",
      "content": "• Small land holdings."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "bhyuu2w",
      "content": "• Dependence on monsoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "cqwxab0",
      "content": "• Low productivity."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "olmi9tn",
      "content": "• Lack of modern technology."
    },
    {
      "id": "geq86ob",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "9. Government Initiatives"
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Frequently tested: Distinguishing features, sowing time, and harvesting periods of Kharif and Rabi cropping seasons.",
        "Key exam focus: High-Yielding Varieties (HYV) and technological interventions introduced during the Green Revolution.",
        "Important topic: Major producing states for key food crops and cash crops in competitive exam MCQs."
      ],
      "id": "x5d5vmk"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "vkmiom6",
      "content": "• Pradhan Mantri Fasal Bima Yojana – crop insurance scheme."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "itu1mgo",
      "content": "• Soil Health Card Scheme – improves soil fertility."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "2cfcasz",
      "content": "• Pradhan Mantri Krishi Sinchai Yojana – irrigation development."
    },
    {
      "id": "3um6xi5",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Important Facts"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "y79rku0",
      "content": "• Kharif crops are sown with the onset of monsoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "d3ufnge",
      "content": "• Punjab and Haryana benefited most from Green Revolution."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "93157un",
      "content": "• Rice is the staple food crop of India."
    }
